        <mxCell id="fl2xxz8JBXYA4Ts9sRSv-22" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;XDR Architecture&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;This is a depection of a security incedent moving through the XDR archetecture of a medium sized business. The end to end flow begins with a threat detected on an endpoint. An agent sends log data to be stored and analysed by the XDR platform. An investigation is initiated, the threat gets remediated, and a report is documented covering the entire process.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
